Package: flopr
Type: Package
Title: Normalisation and Calibration of Flow Cytometry and Plate Reader Data
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Fedorec", "Alex J H", email = "alexander.fedorec.13@ucl.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
  person("Robinson", "Clare", role = c("aut")))
Description: Provides tools to parse, normalise, and calibrate absorbance
    and fluorescence data from plate reader and flow cytometry experiments,
    converting raw instrument output into standardised units for comparison
    across instruments and experiments.
URL: https://github.com/ucl-cssb/flopr
